   "body": [
    {
     "t": "h3",
     "a": {
      "id": "introduction"
     },
     "c": [
      {
       "t": "strong",
       "c": [
        "Introduction"
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "ul",
     "c": [
      "\n",
      {
       "t": "li",
       "c": [
        {
         "t": "strong",
         "c": [
          "Why:"
         ]
        },
        " Managing, backing up, and manipulating aggregation schedules at scale in SailPoint Identity Security Cloud (ISC) can be a common operational headache. Native functionality does not provide a single-click mechanism to “pause” all aggregations during major maintenance windows, nor an out-of-the-box way to export and import schedule configurations across environments or during disaster recovery scenarios."
       ]
      },
      "\n",
      {
       "t": "li",
       "c": [
        {
         "t": "strong",
         "c": [
          "Problem:"
         ]
        },
        " Performing bulk modifications across dozens or hundreds of sources traditionally requires repetitive manual UI navigation or running custom, ad-hoc API scripts without an audit trail. Administrators lack a centralized, self-service interface to safely pause tenant-wide aggregations and restore them with confidence."
       ]
      },
      "\n",
      {
       "t": "li",
       "c": [
        {
         "t": "strong",
         "c": [
          "Goal:"
         ]
        },
        " Deliver an automated, enterprise-ready toolkit utilizing SailPoint Workflows and the Privileged Action Gateway (PAG) that gives administrators push-button control over aggregation schedules—incorporating safety checks, automated backups, and audit logging."
       ]
      },
      "\n"
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "h3",
     "a": {
      "id": "solution-overview"
     },
     "c": [
      {
       "t": "strong",
       "c": [
        "Solution Overview"
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "ul",
     "c": [
      "\n",
      {
       "t": "li",
       "c": [
        {
         "t": "strong",
         "c": [
          "Tech Stack:"
         ]
        },
        " 1 Form + 1 Workflow + 2 PowerShell Reporting Scripts executed via PAG."
       ]
      },
      "\n",
      {
       "t": "li",
       "c": [
        {
         "t": "strong",
         "c": [
          "High-Level Flow:"
         ]
        },
        " The solution centers around a Workflow Form that allows administrators to select from several powerful Actions:\n",
        {
         "t": "ol",
         "c": [
          "\n",
          {
           "t": "li",
           "c": [
            "\n",
            {
             "t": "p",
             "c": [
              {
               "t": "strong",
               "c": [
                "Export:"
               ]
              },
              " Scans all sources in the tenant in parallel, captures their Account and Group aggregation schedules, and writes them to a local CSV file on the PAG server (",
              {
               "t": "code",
               "c": [
                "C:\\Scripts\\Aggregation Exports"
               ]
              },
              ")."
             ]
            },
            "\n",
            {
             "t": "p",
             "c": [
              "Additionally, the CSV file is automatically emailed to the individual who ran the launcher. This is achieved by passing the launcher’s email address to the PowerShell script using the ",
              {
               "t": "code",
               "c": [
                "$.getIdentity.attributes.email"
               ]
              },
              " variable, which is fetched dynamically via the ",
              {
               "t": "code",
               "c": [
                "Get Identity"
               ]
              },
              " action using the ",
              {
               "t": "code",
               "c": [
                "$.trigger.launchedBy.id"
               ]
              },
              " expression from the trigger payload."
             ]
            },
            "\n"
           ]
          },
          "\n"
         ]
        },
        "\n"
       ]
      },
      "\n"
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "div",
     "a": {
      "class": "d-wrap",
      "data-wrap": "center"
     },
     "c": [
      "\n",
      {
       "t": "lightbox",
       "a": {
