    {
     "t": "p",
     "c": [
      {
       "t": "strong",
       "c": [
        "Email Output Example:"
       ]
      },
      {
       "t": "br"
      },
      "\n"
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "lightbox",
     "a": {
      "full": "https://global.discourse-cdn.com/sailpoint/original/3X/6/d/6db76c0b5a31bafd4c9966a2000275294b528b22.png",
      "src": "https://global.discourse-cdn.com/sailpoint/optimized/3X/6/d/6db76c0b5a31bafd4c9966a2000275294b528b22_2_690x165.png",
      "srcSet": "https://global.discourse-cdn.com/sailpoint/optimized/3X/6/d/6db76c0b5a31bafd4c9966a2000275294b528b22_2_690x165.png, https://global.discourse-cdn.com/sailpoint/optimized/3X/6/d/6db76c0b5a31bafd4c9966a2000275294b528b22_2_1035x247.png 1.5x, https://global.discourse-cdn.com/sailpoint/original/3X/6/d/6db76c0b5a31bafd4c9966a2000275294b528b22.png 2x",
      "alt": "Screenshot_Export_Email",
      "width": "690",
      "height": "165"
     }
    },
    {
     "t": "ol",
     "a": {
      "start": "2"
     },
     "c": [
      "\n",
      {
       "t": "li",
       "c": [
        "\n",
        {
         "t": "p",
         "c": [
          {
           "t": "strong",
           "c": [
            "Import:"
           ]
          },
          " Reads a previously exported CSV file and restores the schedules back into SailPoint."
         ]
        },
        "\n",
        {
         "t": "p",
         "c": [
          {
           "t": "strong",
           "c": [
            "How it captures options:"
           ]
          },
          " When the Workflow triggers, it first runs ",
          {
           "t": "code",
           "c": [
            "Get-AggregationScheduleFiles.ps1"
           ]
          },
          " via PAG. This script scans the local ",
          {
           "t": "code",
           "c": [
            "C:\\Scripts\\Aggregation Exports"
           ]
          },
          " directory for all ",
          {
           "t": "code",
           "c": [
            ".csv"
           ]
          },
          " files and returns them as a JSON array of label/value pairs. This array is seamlessly mapped into the ",
          {
           "t": "code",
           "c": [
            "inputForForm_array_importoptions"
           ]
          },
          " attribute of the Interactive Form, providing the user with a dynamic dropdown of all available export files."
         ]
        },
        "\n",
        {
         "t": "p",
         "c": [
          {
           "t": "strong",
           "c": [
            "How updates are executed:"
           ]
          },
          " Once a file is selected, the ",
          {
           "t": "code",
           "c": [
            "Manage-AggregationSchedules.ps1"
           ]
          },
          " script is launched with the chosen filename. It imports the selected CSV, iterates through each row, and uses the API endpoint ",
          {
           "t": "code",
           "c": [
            "/sources/v1/:id/schedules"
           ]
          },
          " to systematically ",
          {
           "t": "code",
           "c": [
            "DELETE"
           ]
          },
          " any existing schedule and ",
          {
           "t": "code",
           "c": [
            "POST"
           ]
          },
          " the restored CRON expressions back to each source."
         ]
        },
        "\n"
       ]
      },
      "\n"
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "div",
     "a": {
      "class": "d-wrap",
      "data-wrap": "center"
     },
     "c": [
      "\n",
      {
       "t": "lightbox",
       "a": {
        "full": "https://global.discourse-cdn.com/sailpoint/original/3X/6/c/6c1bbfe26254d930f26e0bef59501c24b963bf74.png",
